        "description": {
          "text": "Updated labeling to add maribavir dose adjustment with rifabutin, revised use with strong/moderate CYP3A4 inducers, and added clinical resistance data",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for updates to the USPI to include data from physiologically-based pharmacokinetic (PBPK) simulations to support a maribavir dose adjustment when coadministered with rifabutin, updates to language regarding use with strong/moderate CYP3A4 inducers, and updates to include clinical resistance data based on the SHP620-303 resistance report.",
              "doc_id": "24c987c3-a660-5b01-b9e4-28ba2f2b22e1",
